# 11. What happens when a Pod crashes?

Kubernetes automatically:

1. Detects failure
2. Removes failed Pod
3. Creates replacement Pod

This is self-healing.

---

# 12. Difference Between Deployment and StatefulSet?

| Deployment       | StatefulSet      |
| ---------------- | ---------------- |
| Stateless apps   | Stateful apps    |
| Random Pod names | Stable Pod names |
| Web servers      | Databases        |

Example:

Deployment:

```
web-x83jd
web-k91ka
```

StatefulSet:

```
mysql-0
mysql-1
mysql-2
```

