# Part 7 – Deployment Questions

---

# 23. Explain Rolling Update

Old Pods are gradually replaced.

Example:

```
Version 1

Pod
Pod
Pod


Update


Version 2

Pod
Pod
Pod
```

---

# 24. How do you rollback a deployment?

Command:

```bash
kubectl rollout undo deployment app
```

---

# 25. Difference Between Blue-Green and Canary Deployment?

## Blue-Green

Two complete environments.

```
Blue = Old

Green = New
```

Switch traffic.

---

## Canary

Small percentage receives new version.

```
90% v1

10% v2
```

